            <item>
              
                <title>
                  
                  
                  FreeBSD 14.5-BETA3 Available
                </title>
              
              
                <description>
                  
                  
                  The third BETA build for the FreeBSD 14.5 release cycle is now available. ISO images for the amd64, i386, armv7, aarch64, powerpc, powerpcspe, powerpc64, powerpc64le, and riscv64 architectures are FreeBSD mirror sites.
                </description>
              
              <link>https://www.freebsd.org/news/newsflash/#2026-08-22:1</link>
